    "title": "Rodent droppings in San Jose Safeway leads to temporary closure - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stephanie Rothman ,\n1 hours ago SAN JOSE, Calif. (KRON) — A Safeway supermarket on Hamilton Avenue in San José was closed on Monday and Tuesday following reports of rodent droppings found inside the store. The facility passed a follow-up health inspection on Tuesday and has since reopened to shoppers. The closure was ordered... Read full article",
